invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the bundle call stops comparing its count with anchor_max, so a
  bundle of more roots than the caller's entries writes past the caller's
  array. test_bundle_counts gives one and thirteen entries and a file of
  one root more, and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ || count == anchor_max) {
--- new
        if (next != PEM_BLOCKS_READ) {
